  "title": "Demi-Glace",
  "description": "Learn how to make demi-glace with Chef&#39;s John&#39;s recipe that creates a pure veal stock reduction from veal joint and marrow bones, a mirepoix, and tomato.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-10-10T00:52:06-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-02-13T14:13:27-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT40M",
  "cook_time": "PT1200M",
  "total_time": "PT1750M",
  "yield": [
    "32",
    "16 1-cup blocks"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Sauce"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "French"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "French"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "10 pounds veal bones (joint and marrow bones)",
    "1 tablespoon vegetable oil",
    "3 medium onions, cut into eighths",
    "4 medium carrots, cut into 2-inch pieces",
    "4 ribs celery, cut into 2-inch pieces",
    "1 (6 ounce) can tomato paste",
    "10 quarts cold water",
    "2 cups cold water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EGeEcbaMz38lR4GtYFQQfQzmItQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-1-61736d34cd3541f38418cea74f743b04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Place veal bones in a roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k-v7mZpZywepzMfTcQlWK_hT6Nw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-2-a042a389ab5649d6bed677afb4455cd8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast bones in the preheated oven until well-browned, about 1 hour 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AIvlTPK2K3_2kNMO62bM4gN3Vys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-3-1ef175814219489e8584ad071189b931.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the bones are roasting, drizzle oil onto a baking sheet. Add onions, carrots, and celery, then spread tomato paste over top. Mix until vegetables are well coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ukpS8s5Kf8ewGlByQAQ9SETuD_g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-4-alt-a215668025664c5fa0799eddb758d8f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast vegetables on another rack in the oven until well-browned, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lEPU6YS_0UMFHnfhTPa3WlZkWx4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-5-16ec808dea604332a44702c058d54728.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer vegetables and bones to a large stockpot. Pour 10 quarts water into the stockpot and set over medium-high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-T7MlXd7_HtNfCcQft2op43T2ww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-6-a51a8f82bfe04d42842e16523af3dd8b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, pour 2 cups water into the roasting pan used for the bones. Set the pan on the stovetop over high heat; bring liquid to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off of the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4ZIHJk9JrR36mifhrD-c0gesd4Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-7-d1cdd06596b24b258bec1045243340e1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour liquid and browned bits into the stockpot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_ddEBGQfxSD5Wpu1HnkalQA7waU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-8-a5dcc4518a764ec8902263dfcb4b61ca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring contents of the stockpot to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer gently, skimming foam as necessary, until meat and all connective tissues are completely off the bones, about 18 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qd_aRbndxDYL4r6CFMN_SSwF9t8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-9-6cec66a8bb8e4e25aa7dbd67bc06efdd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set a colander over a bowl. Ladle vegetables, bones, and meat into the colander. Discard vegetables, bones, and meat; return any broth to the stockpot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yDdKpEW45Y_3hBN0ZWWXvPFBOhU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-10-4caaba46d59547368e93db3cb1dfa400.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring broth to a boil. Boil until broth reduces to approximately 1 gallon in volume, 30 minutes to 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/le2NMVBU0miyTjv80md3n7_jD_4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-11-5fd86048a03d4225b7eb6d409848021b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain broth through a fine-mesh strainer into a large container set in an ice bath; chill to room temperature, 30 to 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yI8VQzdMzq9Es3zKRlPjUUGnqDk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-12-2-063dad6a495d43a688f349cb38791480.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover the container with a lid or plastic wrap, then chill in the refrigerator until demi-glace is cold and set, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RGqatK39zS_499i27HCPWeUCois=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-12-1-6c522e1486954d18b1f4b44705dc9e52.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_13.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scrape and discard any fat from the surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EM0StXvze83HoHZX-8b3P3PAYIA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-13-9226fa61898b47a2b1c0b167205c6458.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_14.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn demi-glace out onto a work surface. Cut into 16 blocks. Wrap each block in plastic wrap and store in a resealable plastic bag in the freezer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5_j42dEreeHRZSfmFIoTkOrl9cc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-step-14-1f134c4aab5541058f7a55dce0cd910a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_15.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZvBQ-PoWqo3rmId8GnzYheieTqs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-241898-demi-glace-ddmfs-4x3-1c90e9739d7c4a8d85ffd385011cdf1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241898/step_16.webp"
    }
  ],
